body.note:
Since the task steps are inherited from
        topic/ol, they will also not be split over two separate pages. However, if
      you want to allow this, add the following CSS
      rule:*[class ~= "task/steps"] {
    break-inside:auto;
}

section.p:
If you want to avoid page breaks only if the content fits on a page, use
        the -oxy-avoid-if-fits value for the CSS properties that control page
        breaks (break-inside, break-before,
          break-after, page-break-*).
        *[class ~= "topic/table"] {
  break-inside: -oxy-avoid-if-fits;
}
*[class ~= "topic/ol"] {
  break-inside: -oxy-avoid-if-fits;
}
*[class ~= "topic/ul"] {
  break-inside: -oxy-avoid-if-fits;
}
